  "review_notes": [
    "Reconciled with JOS.13.7, 13.14, 13.20 and 13.33: the single written *the* of עָרֵי הַגִּלְעָד belongs to the article on the rectum, and the construct noun keeps only *cities* (rule 29).",
    "The earlier reading, which supplied the *the* on the construct and left the article unrepresented, is named in that unit's note as the competing one; it is the correct treatment only where the ASV writes no *the* for the phrase at all, as at JOS.13.11 and JOS.13.31."
